sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Chargewire server
  C->>S: POST /chargewire/v1/sessions/{id}/statements<br/>Prefer: respond-async, Idempotency-Key
  S-->>C: 201 statement document (queued), Location
  loop until the state is terminal
    C->>S: GET …/statements/{statement_id}<br/>Prefer: wait=10
    Note over S: holds the answer until the state<br/>changes or 10 s pass (long_poll)
    S-->>C: 200 running, progress
  end
  S-->>C: 200 succeeded, result: schema, partitions, retained, expires_at
  C->>S: GET …/statements/{statement_id}/result
  S-->>C: 200 Arrow IPC stream
  C->>S: DELETE …/statements/{statement_id}
  S-->>C: 204 (result freed)
